WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.630
A screening test for a rare disease.

2
00:00:02.680 --> 00:00:04.830
One per cent of people have it.

3
00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.380
With the disease, the test is positive
ninety-five per cent of the time.

4
00:00:09.430 --> 00:00:13.220
Without it, it's negative
ninety-five per cent of the time.

5
00:00:13.270 --> 00:00:14.570
You take the test.

6
00:00:14.620 --> 00:00:16.280
It comes back positive.

7
00:00:16.330 --> 00:00:18.940
So how likely is it
that you really have it?

8
00:00:18.990 --> 00:00:20.290
Ninety-five per cent?

9
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:21.830
Five per cent?

10
00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:25.760
In this mission, you'll see how the words
given that restrict you to part of a

11
00:00:25.810 --> 00:00:27.080
population.

12
00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:31.350
You'll imagine ten thousand people,
sorted in a table or a tree.

13
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.400
And you'll work backwards on a
tree, from a result to its cause.

14
00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:39.710
Your mission: work out how likely
it is that you have the disease.
